    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582490/extras/f8fd5de0d6f023b6a8ba0c893819e596.avif?t=1488337044\" /></div><br><br>Notice: The Demo is a pre-alpha version of Lighting End VR.<br><br>Have you ever imagined dominating the light in VR?<br><br>In the peaceful universe, there are some Seeds of Light. They are wrapped in Dark Flower, waiting for the light coming. \u201cLighting End VR\u201d is a fun and aesthetic optical path puzzle VR game, with the vast universe as background, walking through the beautiful and cute planet. Players need to use the mirrors to change the light path from Light Planet, bypassing many obstacles to make it point to the Dark Flower, thus liberating the Seed of Light. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582490/extras/4dba369549bb4b4b4a963c50948922c1.avif?t=1488337044\" /></div><br>In each levels, there are unique optical devices, Light Planet, Light Block Planets and Dark Flower. Light Planet is the starting point, and the Dark Flower is the terminal point. You need to drag the light indirectly to rotate the Light Planet and the optical devices, light up the Dark Flower, and liberate the Seed of Light hidden in the Dark Flower.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582490/extras/ddab8362a1512253989b9170e4ffd52f.avif?t=1488337044\" /></div><br>\u25a0 Artistic Low Ploy style universe scene<br>\u25a0 Tricky level design<br>\u25a0 Unique optical device<br>\u25a0 Full of Zen aura<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582490/extras/d66f579eb373636d662923a9d24b2d1c.avif?t=1488337044\" /></div><br>\u25a0 The full version will be based on chapters and levels.<br>\u25a0 More colorful lights will be added.<br>\u25a0 More optical divice will be added.",
